{
  "schemaVersion": "1.0",
  "formId": "form_18",
  "formNumber": "18",
  "officialName": "Request / Express Request for Examination of Application for Patent",
  "purpose": "Request that a patent application be examined under Sections 12 and 13 — as an ordinary request by the applicant, an express request (PCT national phase, examined without waiting for the 31-month period), or a request by any other interested person.",
  "legalReference": {
    "act": ["THE PATENTS ACT, 1970 (39 of 1970)", "Section 11B"],
    "rules": ["THE PATENTS RULES, 2003", "Rules 20(4)(ii) and 24B(1)(i)"]
  },
  "pageCount": 1,
  "fee": { "model": "first_schedule", "note": "For fee: See First Schedule." },
  "layout": {
    "columns": 1,
    "notes": "Single-column, sectioned form (1-4) with a FOR OFFICE USE ONLY header block. The three request scenarios — applicant/ordinary, applicant/express (PCT), and interested person — are alternatives: complete Section 2 OR Section 3, and strike out the column that is not applicable."
  },

  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "office_use",
      "title": "FOR OFFICE USE ONLY",
      "officeUseOnly": true,
      "fields": [
        { "id": "rq_no", "kind": "text", "label": "RQ. No", "officeUseOnly": true },
        { "id": "filing_date", "kind": "date", "label": "Filing Date", "officeUseOnly": true },
        { "id": "fee_paid", "kind": "number", "label": "Amount of Fee Paid", "format": "currency", "officeUseOnly": true },
        { "id": "cbr_no", "kind": "text", "label": "CBR No", "officeUseOnly": true },
        { "id": "office_signature", "kind": "signature", "label": "Signature", "officeUseOnly": true }
      ]
    },

    {
      "id": "requester",
      "title": "1. APPLICANT(S) / OTHER INTERESTED PERSON",
      "fields": [
        {
          "id": "name",
          "kind": "text",
          "label": "NAME",
          "required": true,
          "validation": { "minLength": 2, "message": "Enter the name." },
          "autofill": {
            "strategy": "direct",
            "sources": [{ "sourceType": "form1", "key": "applicant.name" }],
            "confidence": "high"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "nationality",
          "kind": "text",
          "label": "NATIONALITY",
          "format": "country",
          "required": true,
          "validation": { "minLength": 2, "message": "Enter the nationality." },
          "autofill": {
            "strategy": "direct",
            "sources": [{ "sourceType": "form1", "key": "applicant.nationality" }],
            "confidence": "medium"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "address",
          "kind": "textarea",
          "label": "ADDRESS",
          "format": "address",
          "required": true,
          "validation": { "minLength": 2, "message": "Enter the address." },
          "autofill": {
            "strategy": "direct",
            "sources": [{ "sourceType": "form1", "key": "applicant.address" }],
            "confidence": "medium"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "publication_date",
          "kind": "date",
          "label": "Date of publication of the application under section 11A",
          "required": false,
          "helpText": "From the patent gazette / publication record.",
          "validation": { "notFuture": true }
        }
      ]
    },

    {
      "id": "applicant_request",
      "title": "2. REQUEST BY THE APPLICANT(S)",
      "description": "Complete this section if you are the applicant. Choose the ordinary request or the express (PCT) request. If you are another interested person, complete Section 3 instead.",
      "fields": [
        {
          "id": "request_mode",
          "kind": "radio",
          "label": "Request mode",
          "required": false,
          "selection": "single",
          "options": [
            { "value": "ordinary", "label": "Ordinary request" },
            { "value": "express", "label": "Express request (PCT)" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "ordinary_text",
          "kind": "boilerplate",
          "text": "I/We hereby request that my/our application for patent no. ...... filed on ...... for the ...... invention titled ...... shall be examined under sections 12 and 13 of the Act.",
          "export": { "verbatim": true },
          "visibleWhen": { "field": "applicant_request.request_mode", "op": "equals", "value": "ordinary" }
        },
        {
          "id": "express_text",
          "kind": "boilerplate",
          "text": "I/We hereby make an express request that my/our application for patent no. ...... filed on ...... based on Patent Cooperation Treaty (PCT) application no. ...... dated ...... made in country ...... shall be examined under sections 12 and 13 of the Act, immediately without waiting for the expiry of 31 months as specified in rule 20(4)(ii).",
          "export": { "verbatim": true },
          "visibleWhen": { "field": "applicant_request.request_mode", "op": "equals", "value": "express" }
        },
        {
          "id": "application_number",
          "kind": "text",
          "label": "Application for patent no.",
          "format": "applicationNumber",
          "required": false,
          "requiredWhen": { "field": "applicant_request.request_mode", "op": "isFilled" },
          "visibleWhen": { "field": "applicant_request.request_mode", "op": "isFilled" },
          "validation": {
            "pattern": "^([0-9]{11,12}|[0-9]{1,6}/[A-Za-z]{2,5}/[0-9]{4})$",
            "patternMessage": "Expected an IPO application number, e.g. 202211012345 or 1234/DEL/2015."
          },
          "autofill": {
            "strategy": "direct",
            "sources": [{ "sourceType": "form1", "key": "application.number" }],
            "confidence": "high"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "filed_on",
          "kind": "date",
          "label": "Filed on",
          "required": false,
          "requiredWhen": { "field": "applicant_request.request_mode", "op": "isFilled" },
          "visibleWhen": { "field": "applicant_request.request_mode", "op": "isFilled" },
          "validation": { "notFuture": true },
          "autofill": {
            "strategy": "direct",
            "sources": [{ "sourceType": "form1", "key": "application.filingDate" }],
            "confidence": "high"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "invention_title",
          "kind": "text",
          "label": "Invention titled",
          "required": false,
          "requiredWhen": { "field": "applicant_request.request_mode", "op": "isFilled" },
          "visibleWhen": { "field": "applicant_request.request_mode", "op": "isFilled" },
          "autofill": {
            "strategy": "direct",
            "sources": [
              { "sourceType": "form1", "key": "invention.title" },
              { "sourceType": "form2_specification", "key": "invention.title" }
            ],
            "confidence": "high"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "pct_application_number",
          "kind": "text",
          "label": "PCT application no.",
          "required": false,
          "requiredWhen": { "field": "applicant_request.request_mode", "op": "equals", "value": "express" },
          "visibleWhen": { "field": "applicant_request.request_mode", "op": "equals", "value": "express" },
          "autofill": {
            "strategy": "direct",
            "sources": [{ "sourceType": "pct_document", "key": "application.number" }],
            "confidence": "medium"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "pct_date",
          "kind": "date",
          "label": "PCT dated",
          "required": false,
          "requiredWhen": { "field": "applicant_request.request_mode", "op": "equals", "value": "express" },
          "visibleWhen": { "field": "applicant_request.request_mode", "op": "equals", "value": "express" },
          "validation": { "notFuture": true },
          "autofill": {
            "strategy": "direct",
            "sources": [{ "sourceType": "pct_document", "key": "application.filingDate" }],
            "confidence": "medium"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "pct_country",
          "kind": "text",
          "label": "Made in country",
          "format": "country",
          "required": false,
          "requiredWhen": { "field": "applicant_request.request_mode", "op": "equals", "value": "express" },
          "visibleWhen": { "field": "applicant_request.request_mode", "op": "equals", "value": "express" }
        }
      ]
    },

    {
      "id": "interested_person_request",
      "title": "3. REQUEST BY ANY OTHER INTERESTED PERSON",
      "description": "Complete this section instead of Section 2 if you are an interested person other than the applicant.",
      "fields": [
        {
          "id": "request_text",
          "kind": "boilerplate",
          "text": "I/We the interested person request for the examination of the application no. ...... dated ...... filed by the applicant ...... titled ...... under sections 12 and 13 of the Act. As an evidence of my/our interest in the application for patent following documents are submitted.",
          "export": { "verbatim": true }
        },
        {
          "id": "application_number",
          "kind": "text",
          "label": "Application no.",
          "format": "applicationNumber",
          "required": false,
          "validation": {
            "pattern": "^([0-9]{11,12}|[0-9]{1,6}/[A-Za-z]{2,5}/[0-9]{4})$",
            "patternMessage": "Expected an IPO application number, e.g. 202211012345 or 1234/DEL/2015."
          },
          "autofill": {
            "strategy": "direct",
            "sources": [{ "sourceType": "form1", "key": "application.number" }],
            "confidence": "medium"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "application_date",
          "kind": "date",
          "label": "Dated",
          "required": false,
          "validation": { "notFuture": true },
          "autofill": {
            "strategy": "direct",
            "sources": [{ "sourceType": "form1", "key": "application.filingDate" }],
            "confidence": "medium"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "filed_by_applicant",
          "kind": "text",
          "label": "Filed by the applicant",
          "required": false,
          "autofill": {
            "strategy": "direct",
            "sources": [{ "sourceType": "form1", "key": "applicant.name" }],
            "confidence": "medium"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "invention_title",
          "kind": "text",
          "label": "Titled",
          "required": false,
          "autofill": {
            "strategy": "direct",
            "sources": [{ "sourceType": "form1", "key": "invention.title" }],
            "confidence": "medium"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "evidence_document",
          "kind": "text",
          "label": "Evidence of interest — document",
          "required": false,
          "repeatable": { "min": 1, "max": null, "itemLabel": "Document" },
          "helpText": "List each document submitted as evidence of your interest, as printed items (a), (b), (c)."
        }
      ]
    },

    {
      "id": "address_for_service",
      "title": "4. ADDRESS FOR SERVICE",
      "fields": [
        {
          "id": "address_for_service",
          "kind": "textarea",
          "label": "Address for service",
          "format": "address",
          "required": true,
          "helpText": "Must be an address in India.",
          "validation": { "minLength": 2, "message": "Enter an address for service." },
          "autofill": {
            "strategy": "direct",
            "sources": [{ "sourceType": "form1", "key": "applicant.address" }],
            "confidence": "low"
          }
        }
      ]
    },

    {
      "id": "signature",
      "title": "To be signed by the applicant(s) or by his authorized registered patent agent.",
      "fields": [
        {
          "id": "statement_date",
          "kind": "date",
          "label": "Dated this __ day of __ 20__",
          "required": true,
          "validation": { "notFuture": true },
          "autofill": {
            "strategy": "derived",
            "derivation": "Default to the preparation / signing date; editable.",
            "confidence": "high"
          }
        },
        { "id": "signature", "kind": "signature", "label": "Signature", "required": true }
      ]
    },

    {
      "id": "signatory",
      "title": "Name of the signatory",
      "fields": [
        {
          "id": "signatory_name",
          "kind": "text",
          "label": "Name of the signatory",
          "required": true,
          "validation": { "minLength": 2, "message": "Enter the name of the signatory." },
          "autofill": {
            "strategy": "direct",
            "sources": [
              { "sourceType": "form26_authorisation", "key": "agent.name" },
              { "sourceType": "form1", "key": "signatory.name" }
            ],
            "confidence": "medium"
          }
        }
      ]
    },

    {
      "id": "addressee",
      "title": "To",
      "fields": [
        {
          "id": "addressee_boilerplate",
          "kind": "boilerplate",
          "text": "To,\nThe Controller of Patents,\nThe Patent Office,\nat",
          "export": { "verbatim": true },
          "presentation": { "group": "addressee" }
        },
        {
          "id": "patent_office",
          "kind": "dropdown",
          "label": "at (Patent Office)",
          "format": "patentOffice",
          "required": true,
          "selection": "single",
          "options": [
            { "value": "delhi", "label": "Delhi" },
            { "value": "mumbai", "label": "Mumbai" },
            { "value": "chennai", "label": "Chennai" },
            { "value": "kolkata", "label": "Kolkata" }
          ],
          "autofill": {
            "strategy": "derived",
            "derivation": "Jurisdictional patent office based on the applicant's address or the office recorded on Form 1.",
            "confidence": "medium"
          },
          "presentation": { "group": "addressee", "multiline": false }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],

  "notes": [
    "Note. - To be signed by the applicant(s) or by his authorized registered patent agent.",
    "Note. - Strike out the column which is/are not applicable.",
    "Note. - For fee: See First Schedule.",
    "The three request scenarios are alternatives: complete Section 2 (applicant, ordinary or express) OR Section 3 (any other interested person), and strike out the other.",
    "The ordinary request for examination is time-bound under rule 24B; the express PCT request skips the 31-month wait under rule 20(4)(ii).",
    "Distinct from Form 18A (Expedited Examination), which has different eligibility and fee."
  ],

  "metadata": {
    "sourcePdf": "docs/Form_18.PDF",
    "transcribedFrom": "docs/specifications/form_18.md",
    "status": "draft",
    "authoredFrom": "docs/specifications/patterns/patterns.json",
    "printedHeader": {
      "formTitle": "FORM 18",
      "statute": "THE PATENTS ACT, 1970 (39 of 1970) and THE PATENTS RULES, 2003",
      "subject": "REQUEST / EXPRESS REQUEST FOR EXAMINATION OF APPLICATION FOR PATENT",
      "citation": "(See section 11B and rules 20(4)(ii) and 24B(1)(i))"
    }
  }
}
